{"default":{"entry":{"id":"community-026","title":"田径运动会","kind":"notice","category":"sports","category_label":"运动健身","summary":"校级田径运动会在第一运动场举行，通知要求各学院组织队伍参赛，并附竞赛规程。赛事已结束。","tags":["运动健身","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-a758f60ccd320903e5e14ee3","year":2026,"published":"2026-03-24","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-04-22","stage_end":null,"colleges":["sports"],"levels":["unknown"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"现有标题未明确级别，暂不推定。","audience":"各学院组织队伍参赛。","audience_scope":{"kind":"campus","colleges":[],"evidence":"各学院组织队伍参赛。"},"source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":null,"content_profile":{"sections":[],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true},"truncated":true},"participation_facts":[]}],"collegeSelections":[]},"notice":{"notice_id":"notice-a758f60ccd320903e5e14ee3","year":2026,"published":"2026-03-24","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-04-22","stage_end":null,"colleges":["sports"],"levels":["unknown"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"现有标题未明确级别，暂不推定。","audience":"各学院组织队伍参赛。","audience_scope":{"kind":"campus","colleges":[],"evidence":"各学院组织队伍参赛。"},"source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":0,"content_profile":{"schema_version":"activity-profile-1","processed_on":"2026-10-17","status":"partial","sections":[{"kind":"other","title":"参与信息","items":[{"text":"各学院：","locator":"正文第1段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm"},{"text":"为深入贯彻落实2026年全国两会关于“大力实施健康教育专项工程”的部署要求，全面落实《关于全面加强和改进新时代学校体育工作的意见》精神，积极响应“身上有汗、眼里有光、健康第一”的育人理念，深入实施《成都大学全面加强和改进新时代体育工作的实施方案》（成大发〔2022〕17号），推动学校体育事业高质量发展，持续提升我校群众性体育活动和竞技运动水平，让体育活动燃动校园，让每个学生都能走出教室、走向操场，在运动中强健体魄、锤炼意志、健全人格，充分展示成大人追求卓越、昂扬向上的精神风貌，以强健师生体魄助力国内一流应用型城市大学建设。","locator":"正文第3段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm"},{"text":"根据学校体育工作安排，定于2026年4月22日-23日在第一运动场举办成都大学第三十七届田径运动会。请各学院积极组织队伍参赛，认真做好参赛前准备工作。","locator":"正文第5段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm"},{"text":"附件： 1.成都大学第三十七届田径运动会竞赛规程.doc","locator":"正文第7段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm"},{"text":"2.成都大学第三十七届田径运动会参赛承诺书.docx","locator":"正文第8段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm"},{"text":"成都大学体育运动委员会","locator":"正文第11段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm"},{"text":"2026年3月24 日","locator":"正文第12段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48657.htm"}]}],"attachments":[{"title":"1.成都大学第三十七届田径运动会竞赛规程.doc","url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/__local/B/BD/AC/91DFF37D099F46C3CF05B7197FB_4F6CA3A2_8600.png","status":"未逐项读取"},{"title":"2.成都大学第三十七届田径运动会参赛承诺书.docx","url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/__local/8/72/F7/1E7C41FC5A722974B882AF1D213_3646FD3F_499F.png","status":"未逐项读取"}],"pending":["参与对象本批未提取到","条件限制本批未提取到","地点本批未提取到","报名步骤本批未提取到","材料本批未提取到","日程本批未提取到","活动内容本批未提取到","费用与奖励本批未提取到","岗位职责本批未提取到"],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true}},"participation_facts":[]},"groups":[],"activity_id":"community-026"},"notices":{"notice-a758f60ccd320903e5e14ee3":{"entry":{"id":"community-026","title":"田径运动会","kind":"notice","category":"sports","category_label":"运动健身","summary":"校级田径运动会在第一运动场举行，通知要求各学院组织队伍参赛，并附竞赛规程。赛事已结束。","tags":["运动健身","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-a758f60ccd320903e5e14ee3","year":2026,"published":"2026-03-24","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-04-22","st